{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>全手工製花朵意大利雲吞+紅酒汁粗長麵</p><p>Coffeelin炮台山旗艦店推出晚餐菜單</p><p>Coffeelin 炮台山旗艦店首次推出晚餐菜單，而晚市菜單將由女主廚Johana Pulat主理，帶來一系列北意經典家常菜及手工新鮮意大利粉，絕對是今期的話題店！</p><p>造型別緻可愛南瓜意大利雲吞！</p><p>手工新鮮意大利麵是晚餐菜單的重點，每款意大利麵均是店內每日鮮製。焦點必試南瓜意大利雲吞（Mantova）造型別緻可愛，軟滑鮮甜的南瓜蓉加上蘑菇汁，濃郁細膩。另外推介海鮮意大利雲吞（Adriatico）、紅酒汁粗長麵（Pici al Chianti) 、番紅花忌廉汁鮮蝦手造意粉（Saffron)。</p><p>滋味滿滿嘅主菜及精緻甜品</p><p>菜單上亦供應主菜及甜品，滋味滿滿的番茄燉八爪魚仔配香脆意式麵包片、來自拿坡里的經典菜式黑椒青口煲。甜品推介金黃酥脆的千層酥、椰香芒果則以清爽椰子慕絲及芒果雪葩搭配杏仁餅底，口感輕盈。</p><p>Coffeelin 地址：炮台山電氣路228號地下�電話： 3582 8241 營業時間：星期一： 8:00am – 6pm；�星期日、二及三：8:00am – 8:00pm； 星期四至六：8:00am – 11pm； 意式餐前酒時段：5:00 pm – 7:00 pm 晚餐：7:00 pm – 11:00 pm (最後點餐時間：9:30 pm)</p><p>官方IG：@coffeelin_hk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178677365134858728_20896833146a800093c5f41.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178677365366030589_13273462666a8000980c509.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178677365914313041_1000258566a80009b9d4b1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178677366106795154_925695996a80009d5b24d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178677366300927902_4529495486a80009f44ae3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178677366474978897_11825931716a8000a10905e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178677366641535862_18710571296a8000a2a6e68.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178677366798436918_2701157496a8000a43acef.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178677366970384575_861215276a8000a5e8857.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T06:19:05.616144+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":663,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}